{"text": "The next morning, Rikki went out to explore the big garden. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was full of roses, orange trees, bamboo, and tall thick grass. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There he found Darzee the tailorbird and his wife, who were sitting by their nest and crying. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One of our babies fell out of the nest yesterday, and Nag ate him, said Darzee. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Just then, a big black cobra rose slowly out of the grass. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was Nag, who was five feet long from his head to his tail. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He spread his hood, which had a mark like a pair of glasses on it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Who is Nag, he said, I am Nag, Look, and be afraid. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Rikki was afraid for a minute, but he knew that fighting snakes was a mongooses job. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> While Nag talked to him, Nags wife Nagaina crept up behind Rikki in the grass. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Behind you, Look behind you, sang Darzee, and Rikki jumped high into the air. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He came down on Nagainas back and bit her, and both snakes slid away into the grass.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "n", "e", "x", "t", " ", "m", "o", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", ",", " ", "R", "i", "k", "k", "i", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "o", "u", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "e", "x", "p", "l", "o", "r", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "i", "g", " ", "g", "a", "r", "d", "e", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "f", "u", "l", "l", " ", "o", "f", " ", "r", "o", "s", "e", "s", ",", " ", "o", "r", "a", "n", "g", "e", " ", "t", "r", "e", "e", "s", ",", " ", "b", "a", "m", "b", "o", "o", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "a", "l", "l", " ", "t", "h", "i", "c", "k", " ", "g", "r", "a", "s", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", 